heretic-sacrifice-backdoor-risky = Attempting a sacrifice so close to the gods is risky...

heretic-sacrifice-backdoor-knock = <i>You hear a knocking sound...</i>

heretic-sacrifice-backdoor-knock-deaf = <i>You hear a knocking sound, despite your deafness...</i>

heretic-sacrifice-backdoor-louder = <i>The knocking grows louder...

heretic-sacrifice-backdoor-deafening = <i>The knocking becomes deafening!</i>

heretic-sacrifice-backdoor-punished = <b><i>Your insolence is punished!</i></b>

heretic-sacrifice-backdoor-dodged = The knocking stops - but you can't help but feel like you've dodged a bullet, somehow.

heretic-sacrifice-backdoor-enough = You don't think trying it again would provide any more insight...

heretic-sacrifice-no-targets = No sacrifice targets could be found!

heretic-sacrifice-targets-chosen = Your targets have been determined. Your Living Heart will allow you to track their position. Go and sacrifice them!

heretic-sacrifice-target-line = { $name }, the { $job }.

heretic-sacrifice-accepted = Your patrons accept your offer.

heretic-sacrifice-accepted-high = Your patrons accept your offer <i>graciously</i>.

heretic-sacrifice-cult-warning = A vile heretic has { $verb } one of our own. Destroy and sacrifice the infidel before it claims more!

heretic-sacrifice-cult-warning-verb = sacrificed

heretic-sacrifice-cult-retort = How DARE you!? I will see you destroyed for this.

heretic-sacrifice-cult-attention = You feel that your action has attracted { $attention }.

heretic-sacrifice-cult-attention-word = attention

heretic-sacrifice-reward-servant = A servant of the Sanguine Apostate!

heretic-sacrifice-reward-rapturous = Your patrons are rapturous!

heretic-sacrifice-begin-shudder = { $target } begins to shudder violenty as dark tendrils begin to drag them into thin air!

heretic-sacrifice-revive = { $target }'s heart begins to beat with an unholy force as they return from death!

heretic-sacrifice-victim-slumber = Your mind feels torn apart as you fall into a shallow slumber...

heretic-sacrifice-victim-tendrils = Your mind begins to tear apart as you watch dark tendrils envelop you.

heretic-sacrifice-victim-claw = Unnatural forces begin to claw at your every being from beyond the veil.

heretic-sacrifice-organs-out = Several organs force themselves out of { $target }!

heretic-sacrifice-victim-grasp = The grasp of the Mansus reveal themselves to you!

heretic-sacrifice-victim-invigorated = You feel invigorated! Fight to survive!

heretic-sacrifice-victim-worst-over = The worst is behind you... Not much longer! Hold fast, or expire!

heretic-sacrifice-returned = Your victim, { $target }, was returned to the station - { $state } You hear a whisper... { $area }

heretic-sacrifice-returned-dead = dead.

heretic-sacrifice-returned-alive = alive, but with a shattered mind.

heretic-sacrifice-victim-escape = Your attempt to escape the Mansus is not taken kindly!

heretic-sacrifice-victim-survived = The fight is over, but at great cost. You have been returned to the station in one piece.

heretic-sacrifice-victim-survived-heretic = You don't remember anything leading up to the experience, but you feel your connection with the Mansus weakened - Knowledge once known, forgotten...

heretic-sacrifice-victim-survived-other = You don't remember anything leading up to the experience - All you can think about are those horrific hands...

heretic-sacrifice-victim-failed = You failed to resist the horrors of the Mansus! Your ruined body has been returned to the station.

heretic-sacrifice-victim-failed-memory = The experience leaves your mind torn and memories tattered. You will not remember anything leading up to the experience if revived.

